{"id":"H3269","lemma":"יַעֲזִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"yaaziyyahu","sayIt":"ya-a-ziy-YA-hu","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jaaziah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1Ch.24.26;\nson of: Merari (H4847);\nbrother of: Mahli (H4249) and Mushi (H4187);\nfather of: Beno (H1121B), Shoham (H7719), Zaccur (H2139I) and Ibri (H5681)\n§ Jaaziah = \"made bold by Jehovah\"\na Levite, apparently the 3rd son or a descendant of Merari","glosses":["jaaziah"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jaaziah","kjv":"of Jaaziah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Jaaziah","kjv":"by Jaaziah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 24:26","note":"The sons of Merari: Mahli and Mushi. The son of Jaaziah: Beno.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","transliteration":"ben","gloss":"son: child"},{"id":"H2139","lemma":"זַכּוּר","transliteration":"zakkur","gloss":"Zaccur"},{"id":"H4847","lemma":"מְרָרִי","transliteration":"merari","gloss":"Merari"},{"id":"H4249","lemma":"מַחְלִי","transliteration":"machli","gloss":"Mahli"},{"id":"H4187","lemma":"מוּשִׁי","transliteration":"mushi","gloss":"Mushi"},{"id":"H7719","lemma":"שֹׁ֫הַם","transliteration":"shoham","gloss":"Shoham"},{"id":"H5681","lemma":"עִבְרִי","transliteration":"ivri","gloss":"Ibri"},{"id":"H4188","lemma":"מוּשִׁי","transliteration":"mushi","gloss":"Mushite"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}